    {
      "source": "Default implementation of <a href=\"RepositoryInvokerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvokerFactory</code></a> to inspect the requested repository type and create a\nmatching <a href=\"RepositoryInvoker.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvoker</code></a> that suits the repository best. That means, the more concrete the base interface\nof the repository is, the more concrete will the actual invoker become - which means it will favor concrete method\ninvocations over reflection ones.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"RepositoryInvokerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvokerFactory</code></a> 的默认实现会检查请求的仓库类型，并创建一个最适合该仓库的匹配 <a href=\"RepositoryInvoker.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvoker</code></a>。这意味着，如果仓库的基础接口越具体，实际的调用器也会越具体——即它会优先采用具体的方法调用，而非反射调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
